      "text": "A guy let Claude read his 1994 Jeep's engine computer through a $3 chip.\n\nIt found why the car kept failing smog, and he says it passed. \n\nThe whole thing cost about $15 in parts, and it's free on GitHub. https://t.co/E9kOFaX8sq",
